<!--
  The favourite mark on a thumbnail.

  Untinted, and carrying its own shadow: a tile has whatever frame the video happened to
  start on behind it, and a plain white heart disappears against a pale one. The offset copy
  underneath costs one more path and works on every frame, which a drop shadow set on the
  ImageView would not — that would need a layer.
-->
